			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				480a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.61
			</span></i> O. (prob., 
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1387b33
				</span></i>
			; in bad sense, <i><span class="en">
