				<u>OGI</u>
				339.98
			</span></i> (Sestos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), etc.: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					1.397.9
				</span></i>
			 (Samos, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>).</div>
